[SIZE=6][B]🎃 Halloween Plugin v1.6.1 - Command Conflict Update[/B][/SIZE]

[SIZE=5][B]What's New:[/B][/SIZE]

[B]🎯 Custom Command Prefix[/B]
[LIST]
[*] Configure your own command to avoid conflicts with other plugins
[*] Set [FONT=Courier New]command_prefix[/FONT] in config.yml (e.g., "scary", "spooky", "hw")
[*] When using custom prefix, [FONT=Courier New]/halloween[/FONT] is completely unregistered and freed for other plugins
[*] Perfect for servers with multiple Halloween plugins!
[/LIST]

[B]📁 Player Data Separation[/B]
[LIST]
[*] Player data moved to dedicated [FONT=Courier New]data.yml[/FONT] file
[*] Cleaner config structure
[/LIST]

[B]🔧 Compatibility[/B]
[LIST]
[*] Works on Spigot, Paper, and Purpur servers
[*] Cross-version reflection support for command management
[/LIST]

[SIZE=5][B]Example Usage:[/B][/SIZE]

[CODE]
# In config.yml
command_prefix: "scary"

# Now use:
/scary help
/scary enable
/scary buffs list

# /halloween is freed for other plugins!
[/CODE]

[SIZE=4][B]Full changelog:[/B][/SIZE] [URL]https://github.com/softici/halloween-plugin[/URL]

[SIZE=4][I]Compatible with Minecraft 1.20+[/I][/SIZE]
